l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"Those are on top of the 2 million physical visitors that pass through our venues each year for concerts, tours or dining.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q1-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q1","e":"rhp","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"We are increasing our guidance for the full-year same-store RevPAR growth from a range of 1.5% to 3.5% to a range of 2% to 4% and for the same-store total RevPAR growth from a range of 2% to 4% to a range of 3% to 4.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q1-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q1","e":"rhp","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"As a result, we are raising our guidance for the full-year adjusted EBITDAre for our Entertainment segment at the midpoint by $2.5 million from a range of $45 million to $50 million to a range of $48 million to $52 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q1-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"This venture will bring a unique country lifestyle and music-focused content and programming direct to our core audience through both linear TV and streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q2-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"…on our books for the quarter, which is once more evidence of the visibility that our business model gives us and having now exited our softest quarter of the year with no real surprises, we once again are in a position to increase our guidance for the year, which I'll summarize in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q2-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2019-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"On the back of these strong results for our Entertainment business, we're raising the full year guidance range for adjusted EBITDAre for the segment by $4 million at the midpoint from a range of $48 million to $52 million to a range to $52 million to $56 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q2-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q3","e":"rhp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"…will create a window into all of the best moments that happen in our venues in Nashville and throughout the South connecting fans with both artists new and legendary and coming to them wherever they are, whether through linear 24/7 television, streaming media devices or in our connected venues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q3-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q3","e":"rhp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"As against this backdrop of strength, visibility of momentum in our business, we're able to increase our full year guidance for most of our metrics for the third time this year, and I'll let Mark walk you through the individual ranges, but let's drill down into each of our segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q3-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q3","e":"rhp","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"On the heels of this strong third quarter for the Entertainment segment, we're also raising our full year guidance range for adjusted EBITDAre for the segment, from a range of $52 million to $56 million to a range of $54 million to $56 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q3-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q4","e":"rhp","d":"2020-02-25","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Colin V. Reed","x":"And then you add Block 21 and ACL Live at the Moody Theater in Austin to that mix and you have so many possibilities to cross-pollinate in this segment that would really need a separate call to fully dive into them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q4-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2019 Q4","e":"rhp","d":"2020-02-25","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Colin V. Reed","x":"Block 21 is a mixed-use entertainment complex in the heart of Austin, Texas and is anchored by the 2,750-seat ACL Live at the Moody Theater as well as the smaller 3TEN at ACL Live club, the 251-room W Austin Hotel and 53,000 square feet of Class A commercial and retail space in the heart of Austin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q4-2019-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2020 Q1","e":"rhp","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Fioravanti","x":"These burn rates reflect the implementation of our operating expense reduction initiatives, the suspension of future dividends, the postponement of nonessential capital projects and other cost savings initiatives implemented across the Company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q1-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2020 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Colin V. Reed","x":"From an entertainment perspective, no one in this country is sitting in theaters, concert halls, or the like.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/ryman-hospitality-properties-inc-rhp-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"RHP 2020 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2020-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Colin V. Reed","x":"They're sitting at home watching 