4-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHP 2021 Q4","e":"rhp","d":"2022-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"And so Patrick, I mean, you may want to talk a little bit about the stuff that we have done to eliminate cost out of our business to make sure that our margin performs very, very well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/ryman-hospitality-properties-rhp-q4-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHP 2022 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2022-08-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Colin Reed","x":"And Block 21 we look really forward to getting the hotel rate down, sitting down and planning the movie theater renovation what we will do.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/02/ryman-hospitality-properties-rhp-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"RHP 2022 Q2","e":"rhp","d":"2022-08-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hutcheson","x":"Subsequently, we received net proceeds of $296 million from the sale of 30% of Opry Entertainment Group to the tariffs as well as the recapitalization of OEG with a new $300 million term loan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/02/ryman-hospitality-properties-rhp-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"RHP 2025 Q4","e":"rhp","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Fioravanti","x":"When you look at what transpired last year with Liberation Day, tariffs on and off, some of the different political and geopolitical issues that are occurring right now in the economy and how they are influencing our meeting planner sentiment as well as meeting planner trends, there is just not a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/ryman-hospitality-rhp-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RHP 2025 Q4","e":"rhp","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Chaffin","x":"To your point, cancellations are up about 3,000 room nights, but they were down significantly versus Q3, which is when we saw a lot of the impact of the tariff situation.","url